OL,3,GNEWSA'Choosing sobriety meant walking
OL,4,Aaway from fame'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Jupp spent nearly 30 years of
OL,7,Fhis life in Elbow.
OL,9,FFrom gigging in the pubs of Bury and
OL,10,FManchester to sell-out tours and
OL,11,Fwinning international accolades, the
OL,12,Fdrummer seemed to have everything a
OL,13,Fmusician could ever want.
OL,15,FBut underneath the surface the "myth of
OL,16,Frock'n'roll" was not what it seemed.
OL,18,F"From the outside, I had everything
OL,19,Fyou're supposed to want," he explaned.
